{
  "info": {
    "name": "养老机构管理系统 API 测试集合",
    "description": "基于《需求/API接口文档.md》与后端代码生成的 Apifox 测试数据。\n\n使用说明：\n1. 先在【认证 → 登录（admin）】运行一次，测试脚本会自动把 token 写入集合变量，其余接口无需手工填令牌；\n2. 科室/护理/家属角色接口请在头部用对应账号登录：nurse01、family01（密码均 123456）；\n3. 演示数据中老人 id 1~5、用户 id 1~5、留言 id 1~4、探访 id 1~5（以 init.sql 导入后的数据为准）；\n4. 标注【需替换 id】的地址，请先把列表/任务接口跑一遍，用返回的 id 替换 {} 再发送。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "认证",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "登录（admin）→ 自动写入 token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "登录签发 JWT。响应 data 含 token 与 user 信息。测试脚本自动保存 token 到集合变量 {{token}}；换角色测试时改为 nurse01 / family01 再运行一次即可。"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "  console.log('登录成功：' + res.data.user.username + '（' + res.data.user.role + '），token 已写入集合变量');",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('登录失败：' + res.message);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "获取当前用户信息",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "GET /auth/me　权限：登录用户。返回当前用户（不含密码字段）。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "修改密码",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"oldPassword\": \"123456\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"654321\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "password"]
            },
            "description": "PUT /auth/password　权限：登录用户。新密码 6~20 位；改完需重新登录。演示环境密码改回去用 123456。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "用户管理（admin）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "用户分页列表",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users?page=1&size=10&username=&role=nurse",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "size", "value": "10" },
                { "key": "username", "value": "", "description": "可选，模糊查询" },
                { "key": "role", "value": "nurse", "description": "可选：admin/nurse/family" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /users　权限：admin。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "新增用户",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"nurse_test\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\",\n  \"realName\": \"测试护士\",\n  \"role\": \"nurse\",\n  \"phone\": \"13800001111\",\n  \"status\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users"]
            },
            "description": "POST /users　权限：admin。用户名唯一；新增时 status 不填默认 1（启用）。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "修改用户",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"nurse_test\",\n  \"realName\": \"王护士\",\n  \"role\": \"nurse\",\n  \"phone\": \"13800002222\",\n  \"status\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/6",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "6"]
            },
            "description": "PUT /users/{id}　权限：admin。username 必填但不可修改（需原样传回）；{id} 用列表返回的 id 替换。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "删除用户",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/6",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "6"]
            },
            "description": "DELETE /users/{id}　权限：admin。不能删除自己；删除家属账号会同步解除其与老人的关联。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "重置密码（重置为 123456）",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/2/password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "2", "password"]
            },
            "description": "PUT /users/{id}/password　权限：admin。把用户 2（nurse01）密码重置为默认密码 123456。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "操作日志（admin）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "日志分页查询",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/logs?page=1&size=10&username=&startTime=&endTime=",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "logs"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "size", "value": "10" },
                { "key": "username", "value": "", "description": "可选，按操作人筛选" },
                { "key": "startTime", "value": "", "description": "可选，yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss" },
                { "key": "endTime", "value": "", "description": "可选，yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /logs　权限：admin。AOP 切面自动记录写操作（操作人/接口/IP/参数截断）。先做几个新增/修改操作再查询，可以看到日志增长。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
